  "scope": "XIRI_IP30_M3C1 attaches IOC3 UART A through com(4), keeps the polled com console for early boot, creates the native tty, and sets cn_dev to the com device for /dev/console. A HEART post-test hook routes SuperIO on Bridge pin 4 to HEART vector 16 and installs comintr. Userland tty open, interrupt-driven transmit, storage and physical hardware are not proven.",
